description	"Imperial Mudtrooper

Expendable Brawlers who go for cheap shots.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cheap Shot (Cripples On Hit)
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (1)
-- Mag Reload
- E-22 Reciprocating Blaster Rifle (1)
-- Mag Reload
- Infectant Grenade (2)
-- Frag Grenade, 0 Damage
-- Cripples, Force Focuses, Poisons

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Close Combat Training (3)
- Assemble (3)
- Ammo (2)
- Melee Resist
- Stamina (1)
- Blast Armor

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]"
